WEBVTT

00:02:54.360 --> 00:03:00.200
And our third mandate is to teach
the principles of nonviolence,

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.336
of empathy, of compassion,

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:04.760
of forgiveness.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.696
And I started with a very simple premise

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.936
that violence is a learned behavior.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.880
No child was born violent.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:15.096
If you accept that as a truism,

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:18.256
nonviolence can also be
a learned behavior,

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:19.616
but you have to teach it,

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.976
because kids are not going to learn that

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.280
through osmosis.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:27.800
Soon after that,
I reached out to my brother here,

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.296
with the attitude
that we had both lost a son.